"BT Panel officially requires a clean system (it installs its own Nginx/"
"Apache/MySQL/PHP, which may conflict with existing services)."
msgstr ""
"宝塔官方要求在纯净系统上安装（会自建 Nginx/Apache/MySQL/PHP，易端口冲突）。"

